<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>@PROJECTNAME@ — Complete User Guide</title>
<style>
body{font-family:"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;background:#0e171d;color:#e3ebf1;margin:17px;line-height:1.56;font-size:12pt}
